OL,3,GNEWSAFifth arrest after attack left man
OL,4,Aseriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have made a further arrest after
OL,7,Fa man suffered "potentially
OL,8,Flife-altering" head injuries when he
OL,9,Fwas struck several times with a blunt
OL,10,Fobject in Nottingham.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Police was called to
OL,13,FHarlaxton Walk, in St Ann's, at 16:20
OL,14,FBST on 12 August after it received
OL,15,Freports of an injured man in the
OL,16,Fstreet.
OL,18,FThe force said a 30-year-old man was
OL,19,Farrested on Thursday on suspicion of
OL,20,Fcausing grievous bodily harm with
OL,21,Fintent and remained in custody.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
