OL,3,GNEWSAFifth arrest after attack left man
OL,4,Aseriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, police said four men -
OL,7,F28, 29, 48 and 61 - had been arrested
OL,8,Fon suspicion of causing grievous bodily
OL,9,Fharm with intent and released on bail
OL,10,F"with strict conditions".
